---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: 홈
---
<section class="hero">
  <h1>daydzip</h1>
  <p>기록을 남기는 공간입니다.</p>
</section>

<section class="recent-posts">
  <h2>최근 글</h2>
  <ul class="post-list">
    {% for post in collections.posts %}
    <li>
      <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
      <span class="post-date">{{ post.data.date | dateReadable }}</span>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
